{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen Greens</strong> is a casual 2D side-view golf simulator that appears in a transparent window on your screen. Play and relax as you sink the ball into the hole with the fewest number of strokes on randomly generated levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Transparent window:</strong> The game fits harmoniously into your workspace and does not distract you from other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcc\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Casual gameplay:</strong> Simple controls and unobtrusive gameplay make the game perfect for relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 <strong>Randomly generated levels:</strong> A new challenge awaits you on the course every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f3 <strong>Variety of locations:</strong> Play on different surfaces, from hills to sand traps and water hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless gameplay:</strong> Enjoy the game at your own pace, without time limits or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Pleasant music:</strong> A relaxing melody accompanies you throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f The progress system is disabled in the demo version: you will not be able to unlock new balls, skins, and visual effects.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763270?t=1760299278","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763270/6793404025dbc368feb2b957cb5a441c33335a3e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760299278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763270/6d7de270ed333aeffcf10beb22db47f3e03a813a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760299278","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/